{'symbol': 'CLX', 'date': '2022-04-28 16:30:00', 'title': 'CLOROX SIGNS SECOND 12-YEAR RENEWABLE ENERGY AGREEMENT, CONTINUING ITS COMMITMENT TO 100% RENEWABLE ELECTRICITY FOR ITS U.S. AND CANADA OPERATIONS', 'text': 'OAKLAND, CALIF. , APRIL 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE CLOROX COMPANY (NYSE: CLX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT SIGNED A 12-YEAR, 47-MEGAWATT VIRTUAL POWER PURCHASE AGREEMENT (VPPA) WITH ENEL GREEN POWER NORTH AMERICA TO PURCHASE RENEWABLE ELECTRICITY BEGINNING IN 2023.'}